## ARTICLE 3 — DISCLOSURE REGARDING TRAINING DATA

**3.1 Unknown Provenance.** You acknowledge and understand that the Distributor has no knowledge of, control over, or responsibility for the Training Data, and that the Distributor is unable to ascertain whether such Training Data was lawfully obtained, properly licensed, or used in compliance with Applicable Law.

**3.2 Unsettled Legal Questions.** You further acknowledge that the lawfulness of using copyrighted or licensed material as Training Data, and the legal status of outputs derived from Generative Models trained thereon, are presently the subject of active litigation and legislative consideration in multiple jurisdictions, and that the resolution of such questions may adversely affect the legal status of the Software or Your rights to use it.

**3.3 Possibility of Memorized Content.** You acknowledge that the Software may contain, without the knowledge of the Distributor, verbatim or substantially similar reproductions of Training Data, including material subject to Third-Party Rights and license obligations (including, without limitation, attribution requirements, copyleft or "share-alike" provisions, patent clauses, or field-of-use restrictions).

